{"seq":3,"slug":"motion-micro","title":"动效与微交互","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/interaction-design/motion-micro","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"motion-principles","title":"动效设计原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/interaction-design/motion-micro/motion-principles","wordCount":4097,"readingTime":17},{"seq":2,"slug":"micro-interaction-patterns","title":"微交互模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/interaction-design/motion-micro/micro-interaction-patterns","wordCount":4479,"readingTime":18},{"seq":3,"slug":"gesture-spatial","title":"手势与空间交互","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/interaction-design/motion-micro/gesture-spatial","wordCount":3360,"readingTime":14}],"introMarkdown":"# 动效与微交互\n\n如果说界面模式定义了交互的\"骨架\"，动效与微交互就是赋予产品生命的\"呼吸\"。本章从三个维度展开：「动效设计原则」建立时间维度上的设计语言，「微交互模式」拆解那些让产品令人愉悦的小细节，「手势与空间交互」探索超越屏幕点击的自然交互方式。2025 至 2026 年，空间计算的兴起让这一领域的重要性显著提升——理解动效与手势的设计逻辑，是从二维界面走向三维空间的必要准备。\n"}